I think that nothing I could write from scratch about this relationship, would made you feel what you are feeling now.
And I think maybe, too, this is as creative and original as I can be.
This technique, which reuses and assigns a new function to the things that already exist, makes me think about literature as linked to ecology.
Could this really be an ecological literature or poetry?
I don't know.
What I do know is that it's a style that works like dreams: it rearranges, reuses, brings us things from places that are far from us, and leaves us with something unique, that reveals ourselves.
It reveals us and allows us to communicate better.
