When I saw the ball in the air I -- JP Sorín: Do you remember Pumpido? The ball going for Valdano?
Announcer: The Argentine goalkeeper didn't make a single mistake in the whole championship -- JP Sorín: And Sebastián Pena, Ibagaza, Coyette grabs it.
And a play starts to develop that will end up in that acceleration as it used to be, with a double wall.
Biagini-Coyette, Biagini-Coyette.
And now I want everyone to shout it!
Goal!
