(Applause) Announcer: Goal!
They will have rains of "no", winds of "no".
Super blows of "no".
Follow your instinct, pursue your trance of happiness.
Give it all, go for the bottle, go for the ball, always.
Give it all to the fullest.
And to all those who once told you "no", watch out!
