And they can be truly made true, like to be here speaking to you all and presenting it.
And for this video to come full circle, thanks to Gerry, for it to land again here.
This dream truly came true and I thank you for this.
The dream that won't come true is Lorena's, I won't go out for a run with her.
Because she runs 100 km and I can barely go with her the first 50 meters.
Thank you all so much, I'll show you the music video.
