Maria is a girl that goes to the institution, her parents take her to me because she was being bullied by gangs, and the parents come to me saying: "Look Mr. Jaime, we don't want her to be in a gang."
Maria is a little girl of 13 years old.
She has a one year old baby
that's the result of being raped by her own father.
When I went to talk to her father, he told me: "Look, Mr. Jaime." he began, "Maria will be mine until she marries."
