Talk, let's try talking, I tell you my thing, but I listen to you talking.
Listen to you talking, listen to you talking.
Listening to you talking, listening.
Not tribally.
Things are complicated.
You have the answer and you cannot use it.
Looking at others' pain helps you put your own in perspective.
Law written in riddles, stand up for what you are, that they don't decide for you.
You have to move, use the word.
Participation, action, reaction.
